    <string name="service_label">Aila phone control</string>
    <string name="service_description">Aila reads the screen of supported apps only during a task you started, and takes checked steps. Every WhatsApp message is sent only after you approve it. You make bank payments yourself. Screen text may be sent to the cloud server you chose. Automation stops on password and security screens. You can turn this service off in Android settings at any time.</string>
